    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d509">

                <pb facs="0457" n="341" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg341"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/864.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 2, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your February 28. Referring to last statement of Minister for Foreign Affairs,
                    you are instructed to inform him that this Government earnestly desires prompt
                    signing of protocol of arbitration, and issuance of instructions for vise of
                    passports of American citizens of Syrian origin naturalized prior to anti-Syrian
                    law of 1903.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d509-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
